{"name":"Heavy Heart","hex":"#771122","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"heavy heart","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A strong feeling of sadness or misery"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/heavy_heart"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sadness","blocks":[{"text":"Sadness is an emotional pain associated with, or characterized by, feelings of disadvantage, loss, despair, grief, helplessness, disappointment and sorrow. An individual experiencing sadness may become quiet or lethargic, and withdraw themselves from others. An example of severe sadness is depression, a mood which can be brought on by major depressive disorder or persistent depressive disorder. Crying can be an indication of sadness."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/S%C3%A9pulcre_Arc-en-Barrois_111008_12.jpg/330px-S%C3%A9pulcre_Arc-en-Barrois_111008_12.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sadness","wikidata":"Q169251"},{"title":"A Heavy Heart","blocks":[{"text":"A Heavy Heart is a 2015 German drama film directed by Thomas Stuber. It was screened in the Contemporary World Cinema section of the 2015 Toronto International Film Festival."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Edin_Hasanovic%2C_Thomas_Stuber%2C_Peter_Kurth_%282014%29.jpg/330px-Edin_Hasanovic%2C_Thomas_Stuber%2C_Peter_Kurth_%282014%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Heavy_Heart","wikidata":"Q20899456"},{"title":"Heavy Heart (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Heavy Heart are a British alternative rock band formed in 2014 in London. They are notable for writing, recording and releasing a new song each month of 2016, all of which then appeared on their 2017 debut Keepsake."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heavy_Heart_(band)","wikidata":"Q28434577"},{"title":"Heart","blocks":[{"text":"The heart is a muscular organ found in humans and other animals. This organ pumps blood through the blood vessels. The heart and blood vessels together make up the circulatory system. The pumped blood carries oxygen and nutrients to the tissue, while carrying metabolic waste such as carbon dioxide to the lungs. In humans, the heart is approximately the size of a closed fist and is located between the lungs, in the middle compartment of the chest, called the mediastinum."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Heart_anterior_exterior_view.png/330px-Heart_anterior_exterior_view.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heart","wikidata":"Q1072"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Paolo_Monti_-_Serie_fotografica_%28Venezia%2C_1953%29_-_BEIC_6363533.jpg/500px-Paolo_Monti_-_Serie_fotografica_%28Venezia%2C_1953%29_-_BEIC_6363533.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Paolo_Monti_-_Serie_fotografica_%28Venezia%2C_1953%29_-_BEIC_6363533.jpg/500px-Paolo_Monti_-_Serie_fotografica_%28Venezia%2C_1953%29_-_BEIC_6363533.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Sad girls. Photo by Paolo Monti, 1953","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APaolo_Monti_-_Serie_fotografica_(Venezia%2C_1953)_-_BEIC_6363533.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Sadness_at_the_beach.jpg/500px-Sadness_at_the_beach.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Sadness_at_the_beach.jpg/1280px-Sadness_at_the_beach.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Sadness_at_the_beach.jpg/500px-Sadness_at_the_beach.jpg?